OL,3,GNEWSAHighland tourist tax of #5 a night
OL,4,Acould raise #9.5m a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council is to hold a public
OL,7,Fconsultation on its plans for a #5 per
OL,8,Froom, per night visitor levy for stays
OL,9,Fin hotels, B&Bs and short-term lets.
OL,11,FThe proposed charge for hostels and
OL,12,Fcampsites would be #2 per night.
OL,14,FA meeting of the full council in
OL,15,FInverness heard that the local
OL,16,Fauthority had been discussing a
OL,17,Fproposed tourist tax for seven years.
OL,19,FCouncillors were told that if the
OL,20,Ffixed-rate visitor levy went ahead it
OL,21,Fcould raise about #9.5m a year to help
OL,22,Fpay for infrastructure such as roads.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
